<title>UK: Telspec dives into year loss, sees better 97.</title>
<headline>Telspec dives into year loss, sees better 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.1 loss	    vs 17.9 profit</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.1		    vs 3.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     9.91 loss	    vs 8.73 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   63.54		  vs 58.83</p>
<p>NOTE - Telspec, the telecoms equipment maker, said that after a disappointing year, improvements established in the second half of 1996 would continue in 1997.</p>
<p>Full company name - Telspec Plc</p>
</text>
